{"id":"le","lemma":"le","pos":"pron","rank":37,"glosses":["to him, for him; dative of él","to her, for her; dative of ella","to it, for it; dative of ello"],"ipa":"/le/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-le.wav","examples":[{"text":"A Tom le importaba.","en":"Tom cared.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799733"},{"text":"A Tom le importa.","en":"Tom cares.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799732"},{"text":"¿A quién le importa?","en":"Who cares?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438306"},{"text":"Le echo de menos.","en":"I miss him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519166"},{"text":"No le hagas caso.","en":"Ignore him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636547"}]}